    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 1e125d59de496cedf5ae9e3142bffb0396874bd5 -->\n**Delta review (merge of main only; M3, independent of the merge's author M5): clean.**\n\nThe only change since the last review is the refresh merge.\n- **#674:** `MACHINES` and `tests/machine.rs` keep both sides in the same order: main's PathPilot routers (24R, xsTECH Pro, xsTECH), then the 1300PL.\n- **#676:** a conflict-free merge of its parent.\n- **Scope:** `git diff upstream/main` lists only the stack's own files.\n- **Trial merge with current upstream/main:** clean.\n\nGate on #676's merged head, which carries #674:\n- app lib 107, `machine` 32, `plasma_machine` 6, `plasma_profile` 7, `posting` 17, `golden_cl` 24, `tormach_machines` 11, `machine_library` 6, `carvera_machines` 1: all green.\n- clippy `-D warnings` on the app lib, `machine` and `plasma_profile`: clean.\n\nNo needs-rework stands on this head. Merge #674 first.",
